<title>FRANCE: France reports barley bids at 14.49-19.94 Ecus.</title>
<headline>France reports barley bids at 14.49-19.94 Ecus.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- May 15 ---		 --- April 24-</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Barley	153,700   14.49-19.94	233,000  23.68-26.43</p>
<p> Rye	   No bids			  No bids</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
